---
title: Puff Pastry
source: https://www.paulhollywood.com/post/puff-pastry
---

Place @flour{250 g} and @salt{1 tsp} in a large bowl and mix together.

Grate @cold unsalted butter{300 g} into the flour mixture.

Stir in @cold water{120 ml} until the dough comes together.

Flatten the dough into a disc, wrap in #plastic wrap{} and chill in the fridge for ~{30 minutes}.
